  "card": "Suppresses P2P peer announcements during periodic wallet transaction resubmission when `-privatebroadcast` is enabled, instead keeping transactions in the local mempool without re-announcing them. This prevents wallet rebroadcast cycles from leaking the originator's IP address over clearnet connections after an initial private broadcast. The issue affects users configuring `-privatebroadcast` to protect broadcast privacy.",
